    "briefing": "Monaco, May 1988. Senna started on pole in the McLaren-Honda and leads; Prost spent the first half of the race stuck behind Berger's Ferrari. Turbo fuel is down to 150 litres this year. Pit boards only, no radio. Reconstructed race: no lap timing survives, so the laps are rebuilt from the results and race reports. Who led each lap is sourced; the lap times are reconstructed.",
